 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+## Rental service
+
+`createRentalService()` provides an isolated in-memory equipment catalogue and booking desk. Add boards
+or sails with daily prices in integer euro cents, then call `quote({ itemId, start, end })` or
+`book({ itemId, start, end })`. Dates must be UTC midnight ISO-8601 timestamps, and `end` is the
+midnight after the final rental day. Quotes calculate price without reserving availability; bookings
+reject overlapping periods for the same item. Cancellation is not implemented yet. See
+[`docs/rental-api.md`](docs/rental-api.md) for the API contract.
